--TEST--
A refused `(int)` cast inside a sum reports `E0225` alone, because the cast is typed `int` like the `as int` its help names, so the `: int` return still checks
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Till {
    public function add(int $total, float $each): int {
        return $total + (int)$each;
    }
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0225]: `(int)expr` is not supported
  --> case.nvs:4:25
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
